<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ new and o/seas vehicle regs up 15.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>NZ new and o/seas vehicle regs up 15.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of new and ex-overseas vehicles registered in New Zealand in August rose to 20,292 from 17,606 in the same month of 1995, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Within that total the number of new and ex-overseas cars registered rose to 15,665 from 13,181.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
